Dear {{customerName}},

Thank you for your request regarding Additional Services for system {{sid}}.

Following our assessment, please find below the price proposal for the requested service:

Service code: {{serviceCode}}
Service: {{serviceType}}
Scope: {{rrDescription}}

Price: {{price}} {{currency}} ({{priceInWords}})
Price valid until: {{priceValidUntil}}

To proceed, please reply to this email with your written approval and PO number (if applicable).

Please note: delivery of the Additional Service will commence only after receipt of your written approval.

If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out.

Best regards,
SAP Customer Delivery Management
